# FastAPI

Follow `.agents/skills/structure-ddd/SKILL.md` and `.agents/skills/fastapi/SKILL.md`.

- Keep routers thin: validate with Pydantic, call an application use case, return a response model.
- Domain code imports nothing from FastAPI, Pydantic settings or infrastructure.
- Construct concrete adapters only in `app/bootstrap/container.py`.
- Type-annotate everything; run `uv run ruff check .` and `uv run pytest` before claiming done.
